---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site.mjs';
---

<Base
  title="About | SME Lending Platform"
  description="SME Lending Platform is a direct lender and invest platform built around published prices, named underwriters and honest current regulatory status."
>
  <section class="hero" style="padding-bottom:1rem;">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
      <h1>A direct lender with published pricing and a clear regulatory status</h1>
      <p class="sub">We publish our rates and fees, assign a named underwriter to each property case, and charge no application or exit fees on business facilities.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0.5rem;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="stat-band">
        {site.stats.map((s) => (
          <div><b>{s.value}</b><span>{s.label}</span></div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:1rem;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:820px;">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">Story</span>
        <h2>How the platform works</h2>
      </div>
      <p style="color:var(--muted);">
        The market is split: SME borrowers see a summary page and then deal by phone, while investors are offered
        “alternative assets” with little visibility of the underlying lending. This platform publishes its pricing on one
        side and the underlying deals on the other, so borrowers and investors see the same figures.
      </p>
      <p style="color:var(--muted);">
        The current build is a working placeholder: rates are indicative market ranges, and the invest side is restricted
        and pre-authorisation. That clarity is central to how the platform operates.
      </p>
      <h3 style="margin-top:1.5rem;">How we work</h3>
      <ul class="tick-list">
        <li>Published rates are confirmed in the written offer.</li>
        <li>A named underwriter from enquiry through to completion on every property case.</li>
        <li>No exit fees, no ERC and no application charges on business facilities.</li>
        <li>Fast decisions: qualifying business facilities can fund within 24–48 hours.</li>
      </ul>
      <div style="margin-top:1.6rem;">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/products/">See the products</a>{' '}
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/contact/">Get in touch</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="border-top:1px solid var(--border); padding-top:2.5rem;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:820px;">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">Trust &amp; regulation</span>
        <h2>Our honest current status</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:1rem;">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Company</h3>
        <ul class="tick-list" style="margin:0;">
          <li>{site.name} (placeholder) — {site.companyNo}</li>
          <li>{site.ico}</li>
          <li>{site.address}</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:1rem;">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0;">What we are authorised for</h3>
        <p style="color:var(--muted); margin:0;">
          Planned FCA authorisation as a consumer credit firm under {site.fca}. Regulated consumer credit and regulated
          residential bridging (your main home) sit inside those permissions. <b>Commercial and most business finance, and all
          investment activity, are unregulated or restricted</b> and are not covered by the Financial Ombudsman Service or the
          Financial Services Compensation Scheme except as required by law.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0;">What we are not yet</h3>
        <p style="color:var(--muted); margin:0;">
          We are not authorised to hold client money, and we do not promote investments to the public — the invest side
          is gated and before launch. The exact regulatory position, gating and wording need legal input before anything
          goes live. This page will state plainly what changes when that happens.
        </p>
      </div>
      <p class="disclosure" style="margin-top:1.4rem;">{site.footerNote}</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>